#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:-1
msgid "Guide on all the specifics of creating Krita python plugins."
msgstr ""
"Sprievodca všetkými podrobnosťami tvorby python zásuvných modulov pre Krita."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:14
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:14
msgid "Python Scripting"
msgstr "Skriptovanie v Pythone"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:14
msgid "Scripting"
msgstr "Skriptovanie"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:14
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "Plugin"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:19
msgid "How to make a Krita Python plugin"
msgstr "Ako vytvoriť Python zásuvný modul pre Krita"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:21
msgid ""
"You might have some neat scripts you have written in the Scripter Python "
"runner, but maybe you want to do more with it and run it automatically for "
"instance. Wrapping your script in a plugin can give you much more "
"flexibility and power than running scripts from the Scripter editor."
msgstr ""
"Možno máte niekoľko pekných skriptov napísaných v spúšťači Python Scripter, "
"ale možno chcete robiť viac a napríklad ich spúšťať automaticky. Zabalenie "
"skriptu do zásuvného modulu vám môže poskytnúť oveľa väčšiu flexibilitu a "
"silu ako spúšťanie skriptov z editora Scripter."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:23
msgid ""
"Okay, so even if you know python really well, there are some little details "
"to getting Krita to recognize a python plugin. So this page will give an "
"overview how to create the various types of python script unique to Krita."
msgstr ""
"Dobre, aj keď python naozaj dobre ovládate, existujú niektoré drobné "
"detaily, aby Krita rozpoznala python zásuvný modul. Táto stránka teda "
"poskytne prehľad o tom, ako vytvoriť rôzne typy python skriptov jedinečných "
"pre Krita."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:25
msgid ""
"These mini-tutorials are written for people with a basic understanding of "
"python, and in such a way to encourage experimentation instead of plainly "
"copy and pasting code, so read the text carefully."
msgstr ""
"Tieto mini-tutoriály sú napísané pre ľudí so základnými znalosťami pythonu a "
"spôsobom, ktorý povzbudzuje k experimentovaniu namiesto prostého kopírovania "
"a vkladania kódu, preto text čítajte pozorne."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:28
msgid "Getting Krita to recognize your plugin"
msgstr "Ako prinútiť Krita rozpoznať váš zásuvný modul"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:30
msgid ""
"A script in Krita has two components -- the script directory (holding your "
"script's Python files) and a \".desktop\" file that Krita uses to load and "
"register your script. For Krita to load your script both of these must put "
"be in the :file:`pykrita` subdirectory of your Krita resources folder (See :"
"ref:`resource_management` for the paths per operating system). To find your "
"resources folder start Krita and click the :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Manage Resources...` menu item. This will open a dialog box. Click the :"
"guilabel:`Open Resources Folder` button. This should open a file manager on "
"your system at your Krita resources folder. See the `API <https://api.kde."
"org/legacy/krita/html/index.html>`_ docs under \"Auto starting scripts\". If "
"there is no :file:`pykrita` subfolder in the Krita resources directory use "
"your file manager to create one."
msgstr ""
"Skript v Krita má dve súčasti -- adresár skriptu (obsahujúci Python súbory "
"vášho skriptu) a súbor \".desktop\", ktorý Krita používa na načítanie a "
"registráciu vášho skriptu. Aby Krita načítala váš skript, oba musia byť "
"umiestnené v podadresári :file:`pykrita` priečinka zdrojov Krita (pozri :ref:"
"`resource_management` pre cesty podľa operačného systému). Na nájdenie "
"priečinka zdrojov spustite Krita a kliknite na položku ponuky :menuselection:"
"`Settings --> Manage Resources...`. Otvorí sa dialógové okno. Kliknite na "
"tlačidlo :guilabel:`Open Resources Folder`. Tým by sa mal otvoriť správca "
"súborov vo vašom systéme na priečinku zdrojov Krita. Pozrite si dokumenty "
"`API <https://api.kde.org/legacy/krita/html/index.html>`_ v časti \"Auto "
"starting scripts\". Ak v adresári zdrojov Krita nie je podpriečinok :file:"
"`pykrita`, vytvorte ho pomocou správcu súborov."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:32
msgid ""
"Scripts are identified by a file that ends in a ``.desktop`` extension that "
"contain information about the script itself."
msgstr ""
"Skripty sú identifikované súborom s príponou ``.desktop``, ktorý obsahuje "
"informácie o samotnom skripte."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:34
msgid ""
"Therefore, for each proper plugin you will need to create a folder, and a "
"desktop file."
msgstr ""
"Pre každý riadny zásuvný modul teda budete musieť vytvoriť priečinok a súbor "
"desktop."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:36
msgid "The desktop file should look as follows::"
msgstr "Súbor desktop by mal vyzerať nasledovne::"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:38
msgid ""
"[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Type=Service\n"
"ServiceTypes=Krita/PythonPlugin\n"
"X-KDE-Library=myplugin\n"
"X-Python-2-Compatible=false\n"
"X-Krita-Manual=myPluginManual.html\n"
"Name=My Own Plugin\n"
"Comment=Our very own plugin."
msgstr ""
"[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Type=Service\n"
"ServiceTypes=Krita/PythonPlugin\n"
"X-KDE-Library=myplugin\n"
"X-Python-2-Compatible=false\n"
"X-Krita-Manual=myPluginManual.html\n"
"Name=My Own Plugin\n"
"Comment=Our very own plugin."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:47
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Typ"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:48
msgid "This should always be service."
msgstr "Toto by malo byť vždy service."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:49
msgid "ServiceTypes"
msgstr "ServiceTypes"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:50
msgid "This should always be ``Krita/PythonPlugin`` for python plugins."
msgstr ""
"Pre python zásuvné moduly by toto malo byť vždy ``Krita/PythonPlugin``."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:51
msgid "X-KDE-Library"
msgstr "X-KDE-Library"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:52
msgid "This should be the name of the plugin folder you just created."
msgstr ""
"Toto by mal byť názov priečinka zásuvného modulu, ktorý ste práve vytvorili."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:53
msgid "X-Python-2-Compatible"
msgstr "X-Python-2-Compatible"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:54
msgid ""
"Whether it is python 2 compatible. If Krita was built with python 2 instead "
"of 3 (``-DENABLE_PYTHON_2=ON`` in the cmake configuration), then this plugin "
"will not show up in the list."
msgstr ""
"Či je kompatibilný s pythonom 2. Ak bola Krita zostavená s pythonom 2 "
"namiesto 3 (``-DENABLE_PYTHON_2=ON`` v konfigurácii cmake), tento zásuvný "
"modul sa v zozname nezobrazí."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:55
msgid "X-Krita-Manual"
msgstr "X-Krita-Manual"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:56
msgid ""
"An Optional Value that will point to the manual item. This is shown in the "
"Python Plugin manager. If it's `an HTML file it'll be shown as rich text "
"<https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/richtext-html-subset.html>`_, if not, it'll be shown "
"as plain text."
msgstr ""
"Voliteľná hodnota, ktorá bude odkazovať na položku manuálu. Zobrazuje sa v "
"správcovi Python zásuvných modulov. Ak je to `súbor HTML, zobrazí sa ako "
"formátovaný text <https://doc.qt.io/qt-5/richtext-html-subset.html>`_, inak "
"sa zobrazí ako prostý text."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:57
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Názov"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:58
msgid "The name that will show up in the Python Plugin Manager."
msgstr "Názov, ktorý sa zobrazí v správcovi Python zásuvných modulov."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:60
msgid "Comment"
msgstr "Komentár"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:60
msgid "The description that will show up in the Python Plugin Manager."
msgstr "Popis, ktorý sa zobrazí v správcovi Python zásuvných modulov."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:62
msgid ""
"Krita python plugins need to be python modules, so make sure there's an "
"``__init__.py`` script, containing something like..."
msgstr ""
"Python zásuvné moduly pre Krita musia byť python moduly, preto sa uistite, "
"že existuje skript ``__init__.py`` obsahujúci niečo ako..."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:64
#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:86
msgid "from .myplugin import *"
msgstr "from .myplugin import *"

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:69
msgid ""
"Where .myplugin is the name of the main file of your plugin. If you restart "
"Krita, it now should show this in the Python Plugin Manager in the settings, "
"but it will be grayed out, because there's no myplugin.py. If you hover over "
"disabled plugins, you can see the error with them."
msgstr ""
"Kde .myplugin je názov hlavného súboru vášho zásuvného modulu. Ak "
"reštartujete Krita, mal by sa teraz zobraziť v správcovi Python zásuvných "
"modulov v nastaveniach, ale bude sivý, pretože neexistuje myplugin.py. Ak "
"umiestnite kurzor nad zakázané zásuvné moduly, zobrazí sa chyba s nimi."

#: ../../user_manual/python_scripting/krita_python_plugin_howto.rst:71
msgid ""
"You need to explicitly enable your plugin. Go to the Settings menu, open "
"the :guilabel:`Configure Krita` dialog and go to the Python Plugin Manager "
"page and enable your plugin."
msgstr ""
"Váš zásuvný modul musíte explicitne povoliť. Prejdite do ponuky Settings, "
"otvorte dialóg :guilabel:`Configure Krita` a prejdite na stránku správcu "
"Python zásuvných modulov a povoľte váš zásuvný modul."

